@startuml
title Run of show - one app, on your laptop
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #1F4E79
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F2F6FA
  BorderColor #1F4E79
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF8E1
  DiamondBorderColor #1F4E79
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  BorderColor #9E9D24
}
start
:1 hour before: start the app on your laptop,
confirm the real model is connected,
run scripts/check_poison.py ~--level 3 ~--runs 5
(with and without ~--defense), then Reset;
:PART 1 - slides: the problem
one ticket, four levels of permission;
:PART 2 - live app, DEFENSE off
Level 1, then Levels 2 and 3 on the seeded inbox;
if (the room suggests a ticket?) then (yes)
  :add it with Add a ticket
  and run it at Level 1;
else (no)
  :Load backup tickets
  and run one of them;
endif
:say the line - the ticket never changed,
only the permissions did;
:tick DEFENSE, Reset, run Level 3 again
flags, REFUSED lines, approval box;
:legitimate refund: Approve
- real work still finishes;
if (2 minutes left?) then (yes)
  :Level 4 - live, or the record_level4.py video;
else (no)
  :skip it;
endif
:PART 3 - slides: under the hood,
then the repo QR: try it yourself
with your own key;
stop
@enduml
